        {
          "detail": "Public scans of family/line geometries with representable midpoints inside the envelope never fail closed on the n-partition gate. Collapse needs a step below ~ulp/2, but the target half-width plus the envelope force 4(t-2g) > 2g for every admissible tolerance. Fault injection still yields rejected / certificate_structure_invalid with evaluations=0 and empty spans.",
